Z||000012||Raydar||11-18-2001||07:43 PM||||Ronnie,<P>I'm going to put the wheels on the coupe unless I find something else I like. The right front one has a small dent in the lip. (I'm amazed if that's all that's wrong with it. Haven't tested it for warpage, yet. The front suspension was pretty FUBAR'd.) The others are really crusty. Need some major clean up or refinishing.<P>BTW, Nashco had a set of gold wheels for sale in the mall. He's in Oxford Alabama. Only about an hour or so from me.  <P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000013||Raydar||11-18-2001||07:45 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88CoupeV6:<BR><B> <BR>I was probably not the first. I was just joking that it is not such a rare mod now.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You were the first person I heard of on *this* Forum. You answered a bunch of questions for me. Therefore, enabling yet another copycat.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Thanks!<P><P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000014||Raydar||12-02-2001||08:32 PM||||R.I.P.<P>Well, it left yesterday. Here it is all "nekkid".<BR> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/hulk1.jpg"> <P>Cost me 40 bucks to have it hauled off. Actually better than I expected. There was pretty much nothing else left, worth salvaging off of it.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
